  "description": "Built into the launcher: Ultimate Customizer by Kyouko8 (formerly Race and Battle Options).\n- Laps 1-12 up to 250, for single races and cups; three-digit menus and HUD; race clock up to 999:59:99.\n- Battle points limit 5 to 99, time limit and lives up to 60; Capture the Flag and Steal the Bacon points up to 60.\n- Random cup: Square on the cup menu.\n- Copas Adicionales (option): 25 new Arcade cups (8 easy, 9 medium, 8 hard), each built around a character, with their stars. Prepare draws their pictures from your game first.",
